            <sparkle:version>1.2.10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Drag recordings into video editors

Dragging a screen recording from the panel into CapCut didn't work. Now it
does. Cubby hands over the recording file itself, the same way dragging it out
of Finder does, so editors that import media by reference accept it.

Screenshots and recent files drag the same way, and dragging no longer leaves
a copy of the file in your Library folder each time.
]]></description>
